<title>USA: Ballston Spa CSD, N.Y. issue postponed to July 1.</title>
<headline>Ballston Spa CSD, N.Y. issue postponed to July 1.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A $32.4 million Ballston Spa Central School District, N.Y., school district 1997 general obligation bond issue slated for sale on June 25 at 1100 EDT has been postponed.</p>
<p>The offering is now slated for July 1 at 1100 EDT. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
